// A two-package trait build: the `showable` dependency owns the trait and
// its impls, the app implements the extern trait for a local type, and
// dispatch spans the archive — the dependency's ground impl method
// resolves at link time while its generic impl method instantiates in the
// app (weak_odr). The binary's output pins every dispatch path.

// RUN: %rene build --manifest-path %S/trait_dep/rene.ncl --build-dir %t.bdir %rrc_linker | %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LISTING

// LISTING: {{[/\\]}}dev{{[/\\]}}traitdemo

// RUN: %t.bdir/dev/traitdemo%exe_ext | %FileCheck %s --check-prefix=OUT

// Ground dispatch through the dependency's compiled impl…
// OUT: 21
// …its generic impl method instantiated at the app's own type…
// OUT-NEXT: 10
// …the dot spelling on an extern type…
// OUT-NEXT: 3
// …and the trait-path spelling through the app's impl.
// OUT-NEXT: 8
